# GPU 4,5 LSKNet queue, target wall time: about 11-12 hours.
# Reference:
# - 4-GPU LSKNet baseline: about 1h50m for 12 epochs.
# - 2-GPU estimate: about 3h40m per 12-epoch run.
# - Three 12-epoch LSKNet runs should fit roughly in 11-12 hours.
